  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。用心製作。多個活躍模組支援 Fabric、Forge 及 Neo！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>死亡備份是一個模組，能在玩家死亡前將其物品欄儲存成世界資料夾中的檔案。若玩家擁有作弊權限，可透過指令「<em>/deathbackup load &lt;索引&gt;</em>」重新載入物品欄。「<em>/deathbackup list</em>」則可顯示所有最近的死亡記錄及對應索引。物品欄檔案會存放在以玩家名稱命名的資料夾中，因此無論在伺服器或單人遊戲中皆可正常運作。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/extra-bundle.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum's Extra Bundle\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>sendBackupReminderMessageToThoseWithAccessOnDeath</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 true<br>啟用時，當擁有作弊權限的玩家死亡，會傳送訊息告知已建立備份並可載入。<br><br><span><strong>backupReminderMessage</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 \"A backup of your inventory before your death has been created and can be loaded with '/deathbackup load 0'.\"<br>當「sendBackupReminderMessageToThoseWithAccessOnDeath」啟用時，傳送給擁有作弊權限玩家的提示訊息。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/commands.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"指令\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><em>/deathbackup</em> - 顯示可用指令。</span><br><span><em>/deathbackup list</em> - 顯示最近的死亡記錄及對應索引。</span><br><span><em>/deathbackup load &lt;索引&gt;</em> - 載入「<em>/deathbackup list</em>」中由 <em>&lt;索引&gt;</em> 指定的死亡備份。索引 0 始終代表最近的死亡記錄。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>每當玩家死亡，其物品欄與裝備會儲存至「<em>./world-folder/data/deathbackup/time.txt</em>」。預設情況下，若玩家擁有作弊權限，會收到提示訊息，但此功能可在設定中停用。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/death-backup/a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"623\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span>使用指令「<em>/deathbackup list</em>」可查看所有近期的死亡備份。索引 0 始終為最新。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/death-backup/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"623\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span>使用「<em>/deathbackup load 0</em>」指令載入最近一次死亡前的物品欄。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/death-backup/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"623\"><br><br></p>\n<p>另一個包含 NBT 標籤（如附魔與成書）的物品範例：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/death-backup/d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"623\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span>執行「<em>/deathbackup load 0</em>」後，最後一次物品欄順利載入。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/death-backup/e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"623\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以自由在任何模組包中使用此模組，只要下載仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統中即可。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
